# Бренд, i18n и UI

- Product **Postilka**; app URL `https://postilka.ru/app`.
- Russian default UI; next-intl; update all locale files together.
- Stack: Next.js 15 App Router, Tailwind, shadcn/ui — как Erman AI.
- Design: clean dashboard (Stripe/Linear-like); light theme default; no emoji decor.
- Locale-aware dates, ₽, pluralization; org timezone not hardcoded Moscow.
- Accessible: labels, keyboard, focus, loading/error states; status not color-only.
- Provider errors — Russian + next step; no raw API JSON.
- Links/assets via basePath helpers; `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/app/api/v1`.
